qBsOxQ&oe=69A991B9"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4 soundbath.png", "id": "1214899389903140", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820574_1214899393236473_8821545736345454299_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WbmceMOeabAQ7kNvwHw2HDJ&_nc_oc=AdlH696Eoh81GO5a-Uwl45Y_V9fIIIx9UGA2QmzKUE6c0adLpIqolzarbRvFqctuFOE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsMqZv4wac4b72nI-uSaZ5J3sT0Jh3F49mT3h9hq6r6Zg&oe=69A986CA"}, {"file_name": "TRIPP_Screenshot_2560x1440.png", "id": "1422660415743750", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824592_1422660419077083_2120275037635617437_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lU6AgoX2nGQQ7kNvwGC_3Tj&_nc_oc=AdlxBRxnAKor8FLo6oFFdvJ_P0xT9xR3dUa9qPT3bjacmR_IYse8vrhm1j-kGF_vvQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsBpaZgUytX7N2fgAt5S8vzbM7CklSVU1rRkthM4jFZXA&oe=69A9613E"}, {"file_name": "TRIPP_Sound Bath_Screenshots Bowls Fish_2560x1440.png", "id": "1567762020861259", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507818746_1567762027527925_8246139963255701258_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fWAXKBsohWwQ7kNvwEMWFDe&_nc_oc=Adl8Y2MykTlPD6P9O_d6-uVtTsnVwQYJ4CY-LQjzpmflgZjG_5w6o2U2-MRbwfzCmp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsJ4i_-S2dv1941M-01k73PbiLP16J67t29zH-uWFknuQ&oe=69A98D1C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TRIPP_Sound Bath_Video Cover Image_2560x1440.png", "id": "1241952427408769", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499301403_1241952434075435_3015933361298508862_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XMXnWDzSuVEQ7kNvwHkWeYv&_nc_oc=AdkZxwgtszMp0pgULY8NM7QAtEmX5yyIsVw6O25TUYrTPn96BAX__1cqIhEL2dmO_5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuAq1ScygRP_qhCDwaPHJnG-x63BvTVWKaIAhJxIfO_AA&oe=69A962BB"}, "display_name": "Sound Bath by TRIPP", "keywords": ["Music", "Rhythm", "Meditation", "Sound", "Soundbath"], "long_description": "FROM LISTENER TO CREATOR: YOUR PERSONAL SYMPHONY AWAITS\n\n{759779279809918}\n\nForget passive meditation. Step beyond rhythm games. Welcome to Sound Bath by TRIPP, a revolutionary VR music experience where YOU are the composer, the DJ, and the artist. Immerse yourself in a transformative audiovisual journey designed to unlock your creativity and guide you to a state of deep relaxation.\n\nCRAFT YOUR OWN SONIC MASTERPIECE\n\nAt the heart of this experience are incredible, interactive singing bowls. Each bowl is a unique instrument, a gateway to a different sonic texture and visual wonder:\n\nBecome an Interactive DJ: Mix and layer sounds in real-time, creating a generative music soundscape that is uniquely yours.\n\nBuild a Mind-Expanding Audiovisual Journey: Watch as your musical choices paint the world around you with breathtaking, reactive visuals.\n\nDiscover Your Flow State: Lose yourself in a seamless blend of sound, sight, and interaction designed for ultimate focus and calm.\n\nA WORLD-CLASS STUDIO AT YOUR FINGERTIPS\n\nThis unparalleled music creation experience was born from a collaboration with the award-winning team at TRIPP and a curated lineup of world-renowned musical artists:\n\nTi\u00ebsto & 7 Skies\n\nDavid Starfire\n\nLiquid Bloom\n\nCloudchord\n\nWhether you seek boundless creativity, a powerful tool for mindfulness, or simply the ultimate immersive music sandbox, your personal symphony for the soul is here.\n\n{725462406891111}\n", "short_description": "Become the DJ of your own mesmerizing audiovisual journey. Step into a mind-expanding VR music creation experience designed by world-renowned artists Ti\u00ebsto & 7 Skies, David Starfire, & more. Interact with amazing singing bowls to mix your own unique sound bath, creating a personal symphony for the soul. Unleash your creativity and find deep relaxation in this immersive musical sandbox. Your sound, your sanctuary."}]}, "developer_name": null, "d